#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this tutorial we use Simultaneous Perturbation Stochastic Approximation "
"(SPSA), which is a gradient-based optimizer. Next we give a brief "
"introduction to it, and provide the code to implement SPSA using Qiskit "
"v2.0.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam tutorial ini kita menggunakan Simultaneous Perturbation Stochastic "
"Approximation (SPSA), iaitu pengoptimum berasaskan kecerunan. Seterusnya "
"kita berikan pengenalan ringkas kepadanya, dan menyediakan kod untuk "
"melaksanakan SPSA menggunakan Qiskit v2.0.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Introducing SPSA {#introducing-spsa}"
msgstr "Memperkenalkan SPSA {#introducing-spsa}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Simultaneous Perturbation Stochastic Approximation (SPSA) "
"[\\[1\\]](#references) is an optimization algorithm that approximates the "
"entire gradient vector using only two function calls at each iteration. Let "
"$f:\\mathbb{R}^p\\rightarrow \\mathbb{R}$ be the cost function with $p$ "
"parameters to be optimized, and $x_i\\in \\mathbb{R}^p$ be the parameter "
"vector at the $i^{th}$ step of the iteration. To compute the gradient, a "
"random vector $\\Delta_i$ of size $p$ is created, where each element "
"$\\Delta_{ij}$, $\\forall$ $j\\in \\{1,2,...,p\\}$, is uniformly sampled "
"from $\\{-1, 1\\}$. Next, each element of the random vector $\\Delta_i$ is "
"multiplied with a small value $c_i$ to create a random perturbation. The "
"gradient is then estimated as\n"
msgstr ""
"Simultaneous Perturbation Stochastic Approximation (SPSA) "
"[\\[1\\]](#references) ialah algoritma pengoptimuman yang menganggar seluruh"
" vektor kecerunan menggunakan hanya dua panggilan fungsi pada setiap "
"lelaran. Biar $f:\\mathbb{R}^p\\rightarrow \\mathbb{R}$ ialah fungsi kos "
"dengan $p$ parameter yang hendak dioptimumkan, dan $x_i\\in \\mathbb{R}^p$ "
"ialah vektor parameter pada langkah ke-$i^{th}$ lelaran. Untuk mengira "
"kecerunan, satu vektor rawak $\\Delta_i$ bersaiz $p$ diwujudkan, di mana "
"setiap elemen $\\Delta_{ij}$, $\\forall$ $j\\in \\{1,2,...,p\\}$, disampel "
"secara seragam daripada $\\{-1, 1\\}$. Seterusnya, setiap elemen vektor "
"rawak $\\Delta_i$ didarab dengan nilai kecil $c_i$ untuk mewujudkan gangguan"
" rawak. Kecerunan kemudiannya dianggar sebagai\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$[\\nabla f(x_i)]_j \\approx \\frac{f(x_i + c_i \\Delta_i) - f(x_i - c_i "
"\\Delta_i)}{2c_i\\Delta_{ij}}.$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$[\\nabla f(x_i)]_j \\approx \\frac{f(x_i + c_i \\Delta_i) - f(x_i - c_i "
"\\Delta_i)}{2c_i\\Delta_{ij}}.$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Intuitively, since a random perturbation is applied during the gradient "
"estimation, it is expected that small deviations in the exact values of $f$ "
"coming from noise can be tolerated and accounted for. In fact, SPSA is "
"particularly known to be robust against noise, and requires only two "
"hardware calls for each iteration. It is, therefore, one of the highly "
"preferred optimizers for implementing variational algorithms.\n"
msgstr ""
"Secara intuitif, memandangkan gangguan rawak digunakan semasa anggaran "
"kecerunan, adalah dijangka bahawa penyelewengan kecil dalam nilai tepat $f$ "
"yang datang dari hingar boleh ditoleransi dan diambil kira. Malah, SPSA "
"khususnya diketahui tahan terhadap hingar, dan hanya memerlukan dua "
"panggilan perkakasan bagi setiap lelaran. Oleh itu, ia adalah salah satu "
"pengoptimum yang sangat disukai untuk melaksanakan algoritma variatif.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this tutorial, the hyperparameters for the $i^{th}$ iteration, $a_i$ and "
"$c_i$, are computed as\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam tutorial ini, hiperparameter bagi lelaran ke-$i^{th}$, $a_i$ dan "
"$c_i$, dikira sebagai\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$a_i = \\frac{a}{(A + i + 1)^\\alpha} \\quad \\text{and} \\quad c_i = "
"\\frac{c}{(i+1)^\\gamma},$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$a_i = \\frac{a}{(A + i + 1)^\\alpha} \\quad \\text{and} \\quad c_i = "
"\\frac{c}{(i+1)^\\gamma},$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where the constant values are taken as $A = 30$, $\\alpha = 0.9$, $a = 0.3$,"
" $c = 0.1$, and $\\gamma = 0.4$. These values are selected from "
"[\\[2\\]](#references). Appropriate tuning of hyperparameters is necessary "
"for extracting a good performance out of SPSA.\n"
msgstr ""
"di mana nilai tetap diambil sebagai $A = 30$, $\\alpha = 0.9$, $a = 0.3$, $c"
" = 0.1$, dan $\\gamma = 0.4$. Nilai-nilai ini dipilih daripada "
"[\\[2\\]](#references). Penalaan hiperparameter yang sesuai adalah perlu "
"untuk mendapatkan prestasi yang baik daripada SPSA.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here we set the `maxiter = 50`. Note that since each iteration requires two "
"calls to the function to compute the gradient, the total number of function "
"calls will be $2 \\times \\text{maxiter}$. The `maxiter` can be increased to"
" any higher value for better energy estimation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Di sini kita tetapkan `maxiter = 50`. Perlu diingat bahawa memandangkan "
"setiap lelaran memerlukan dua panggilan fungsi untuk mengira kecerunan, "
"jumlah panggilan fungsi akan menjadi $2 \\times \\text{maxiter}$. `maxiter` "
"boleh ditingkatkan kepada sebarang nilai yang lebih tinggi untuk anggaran "
"tenaga yang lebih baik.\n"

